Body:
> Yes, terminal palette is used and supported and we could expose that to the theme as well somehow. Automatic palette updates, if the terminal supports that, will be supported shortly as well.

@kommander, this [PR](https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/pull/9184) adds the feature `system-like custom themes` for referencing the generated "system" theme values within custom themes.

```json
{
  "theme": {
    "background": "system",
    "foreground": "system",
    "primary": "#ff5500"
  }
}
```

